{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790982997,"nonce":"azH5Aa8v6+4qtEsZ9GSovMGSyU8=","title":"Theme: what the blinc_theme port leaves to the style and render work","message":"The Haxe port of blinc_theme (ashui.theme, ashui.animation) covers the token families, the three Universal HID themes, ThemeState, the CSS variable map, scheme detection and the squircle corner resolution. Still open, outside the theme itself:\n\n- **Multi-layer shadows per node.** A node takes one ashui.types.Shadow, so `Themed.shadow` binds the broadest layer of a stack. Hybrid and Restrained use two layers and Expressive three. Blinc's RenderProps already hold a `Vec\u003cShadow\u003e`.\n- **Shadow spread.** ashui.types.Shadow has no spread, so theme shadows with spread (Blinc's ShadowTokens light/dark ladder) lose it.\n- **Clip corner shapes.** Children are clipped with round corners even when the parent was smoothed into a squircle. Blinc carries `clip_corner_shape` from the clip's source.\n- **Explicit corner shapes.** Nothing sets a node's `corner_shape` or `corner_shape_locked` yet. The display list carries them and resolution honours them; a style prop needs to reach them (.squircle(), .bevel(), CSS corner-shape).\n- **Scheme from the window.** The window runner (b0dd7db) should call `WindowTheme.follow(window)` on open and `WindowTheme.handle(event)` for each event, then `ThemeState.tick()` each frame with an AnimationScheduler, in place of the polling SystemSchemeWatcher.\n- **Style sheets.** `ThemeState.drainPendingStylesheets()` and `toCssVariableMap()` wait for the style system to consume them.\n\nKnown differences from Blinc, kept on purpose:\n- `ColorTokens.defaults()` is Hybrid light; Blinc's `ColorTokens::default()` still holds the retired Catppuccin palette.\n- A scheme transition ends exactly on the target colours. Blinc stops within 1 of the spring's target.\n- The legacy per-OS platform themes are not ported; ashui uses the Universal HID system.","files":null}]}